	(text "DIGITAL OUTPUTS - ARCHITECTURE NOTE\n\n* Eight digital outputs for lamps, buzzer, heater enable and auxiliary controls.\n* PC817 optocouplers (U12-U19) isolate STM32 logic from field circuitry.\n* R18-R25 (470Ω) limit optocoupler LED current.\n* U9 (ULN2803A) provides eight active-low, open-collector outputs.\n* U21 converts +24V_PROTECTED to +5V_FIELD.\n* Field loads connect between +24V_PROTECTED and U9 outputs.\n* GND_LOGIC and GND_FIELD remain electrically separate.\n\nNOTE: Verify load currents, startup states and supply isolation before fabrication.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
